{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"frequency-wavelength-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.0.answer","detected_language":"ms","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"frequency-wavelength-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.0.answer","keys":["frequency-wavelength-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.0.answer"],"locale":"ms","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Untuk gelombang bergerak, kelajuan v sama dengan frekuensi f dikalikan dengan panjang gelombang λ. Jika anda tahu mana- mana dua nilai positif, anda boleh mengira yang ketiga, dengan syarat semua kuantiti menggambarkan gelombang yang sama dalam medium yang sama.","record_id":"21a4f37b4c1d9ddf5dc7ac2382de918c2e2a8af700fe15de8056165a61f511d9","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":1.9834763353750304,"source":"For a traveling wave, speed v equals frequency f multiplied by wavelength λ. If you know any two positive values, you can calculate the third, provided all quantities describe the same wave in the same medium.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"d4ac5a05d203a103b48819f732b9e1af0898a00ad4f775d02e5be6ab02ee594b","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Untuk gelombang bergerak, kelajuan v sama dengan frekuensi f dikalikan dengan panjang gelombang λ. Jika anda tahu mana- mana dua nilai positif, anda boleh mengira yang ketiga, dengan syarat semua kuantiti menggambarkan gelombang yang sama dalam medium yang sama.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
